sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Biller
  participant BI as Biller Adapter
  participant PP as Payment Processing
  participant SM as Payment State Machine
  participant W as Wallet and Ledger
  participant AU as Audit Log
  participant N as Notifications
  actor C as Customer
  B-->>BI: refuses payment (error code)
  BI->>PP: PayResult failed with mapped reason
  PP->>SM: apply event BillerRefused
  SM-->>PP: SentToBiller to Failed allowed
  PP->>W: release hold (ledger entry: hold release)
  W-->>PP: available balance restored
  PP->>SM: apply event HoldReleased
  SM-->>PP: Failed to Refunded
  PP->>AU: record who, when, why
  PP-->>N: PaymentFailed event with reason
  N->>C: SMS with clear reason
  Note over PP,W: Unknown payments are refunded only after reconciliation proves the biller never received them
